{
  "_note": "降雨提醒(21 · 迷你档,card-design-system §8.1)。2026-10-08 新增,生成器 gen_weather_more.py。左:结论 + 副文;右:未来 12 小时降水概率柱(≥ 50% 雨蓝)。数据 = weather.df,零新增请求。",
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "set",
        "props": {
          "key": "_sky",
          "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${sky},overcast)]"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_sky},clear)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "linear(#2F7FC4\\,#6FB4E0\\,#A9D2EC)@90|linear(#1F5C90\\,#487F9E\\,#6E9AB0)@90"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_sky},overcast)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "linear(#6B7E8E\\,#93A5B2\\,#B9C6CF)@90|linear(#4A5763\\,#6A7783\\,#8A96A0)@90"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_sky},rain)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "linear(#3E5A73\\,#5C7B93\\,#89A3B5)@90|linear(#2A3F52\\,#42596C\\,#647D8C)@90"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_sky},snow)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "linear(#7C93A8\\,#A8BCCB\\,#D6E3EC)@90|linear(#586A7A\\,#7B8D9B\\,#9FB0BC)@90"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_sky},night)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "linear(#101A2E\\,#1C2A44\\,#33465F)@90|linear(#0A1220\\,#141F33\\,#25344A)@90"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "set",
        "props": {
          "key": "_decor",
          "value": "$[if::(eq::(${_sky},clear),glow,if::(eq::(${_sky},overcast),fog,none))]"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_decor},glow)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "radial(#8CFFFFFF\\,#00FFFFFF)@0.8\\,0.16\\,0.6|radial(#66FFFFFF\\,#00FFFFFF)@0.8\\,0.16\\,0.6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_decor},fog)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "_note": "⚠️ 雾必须是**一层柔光**,不能是「一条 16pt 高、装着横向渐变的 layer」。\n那种写法横向是渐变(两端透明)、**纵向却是硬边**,于是渲出来是一道齐刷刷的白杠 ——\n用户 2026-08-21 真机反馈的「顶部和小组件有白色横条」就是它,而且因为阴天档最常见,\n页头与四张卡会同时出现。radial 四周都柔,没有任何一条边可以被读成线。\n落点定在偏上(cy=0.34):底部有 DIM 压暗层,雾放下面会被压没。",
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "radial(#2BFFFFFF\\,#00FFFFFF)@0.5\\,0.34\\,0.78|radial(#1EFFFFFF\\,#00FFFFFF)@0.5\\,0.34\\,0.78"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#00000000\\,#4D000000)@90|linear(#00000000\\,#59000000)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "srcDot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "10pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "bgColor": "#7FC4F5|#7FC4F5"
      },
      {
        "id": "ttl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "19pt",
        "y": "9pt",
        "w": "129pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${city},--)]",
        "fontSize": "11pt",
        "textColor": "#FFFFFF|#FFFFFF",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "lineBreak": "0"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(findNotEmpty::(${rainNow},0),1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "m1",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "10pt",
            "y": "24pt",
            "w": "80pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.w_rnNow}",
            "fontSize": "16pt",
            "textColor": "#FFFFFF|#FFFFFF",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "lineBreak": "0"
          },
          {
            "id": "s1",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "10pt",
            "y": "45pt",
            "w": "80pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.w_rnNowS}$[findNotEmpty::(${pop},--)]%",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#B3FFFFFF|#A6FFFFFF",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${rainNow},0),1),0,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${rainFlag},0),1),1,0))]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "m2",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "10pt",
            "y": "24pt",
            "w": "80pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${rainAt}",
            "fontSize": "17pt",
            "textColor": "#FFFFFF|#FFFFFF",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "lineBreak": "0"
          },
          {
            "id": "s2",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "10pt",
            "y": "45pt",
            "w": "80pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.w_rnAtS}",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#B3FFFFFF|#A6FFFFFF",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${rainFlag},__none__),__none__),0,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${rainNow},0),1),0,if::(eq::(${rainFlag},1),0,1)))]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "m3",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "10pt",
            "y": "24pt",
            "w": "80pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.w_rnNone}",
            "fontSize": "16pt",
            "textColor": "#FFFFFF|#FFFFFF",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "lineBreak": "0"
          },
          {
            "id": "s3",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "10pt",
            "y": "45pt",
            "w": "80pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.w_rnNoneS}",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#B3FFFFFF|#A6FFFFFF",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${rainFlag},__none__),__none__),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "mE",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "10pt",
            "y": "30pt",
            "w": "80pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "--",
            "fontSize": "17pt",
            "textColor": "#FFFFFF|#FFFFFF",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "lineBreak": "0"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${rainFlag},__none__),__none__),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "line",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "points": "[96.25,46.0,96.25,$[parseNumber::(calc::(46.0-20.0*findNotEmpty::(get::(${hourly},precipitation_probability[0]),0)/100),0.0)]]",
            "lineWidth": "2.6pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "strokeColor": "$[if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${hourly},precipitation_probability[0]),0),50),#9FD4FF,#80FFFFFF)]"
          },
          {
            "type": "line",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "points": "[100.75,46.0,100.75,$[parseNumber::(calc::(46.0-20.0*findNotEmpty::(get::(${hourly},precipitation_probability[1]),0)/100),0.0)]]",
            "lineWidth": "2.6pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "strokeColor": "$[if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${hourly},precipitation_probability[1]),0),50),#9FD4FF,#80FFFFFF)]"
          },
          {
            "type": "line",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "points": "[105.25,46.0,105.25,$[parseNumber::(calc::(46.0-20.0*findNotEmpty::(get::(${hourly},precipitation_probability[2]),0)/100),0.0)]]",
            "lineWidth": "2.6pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "strokeColor": "$[if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${hourly},precipitation_probability[2]),0),50),#9FD4FF,#80FFFFFF)]"
          },
          {
            "type": "line",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "points": "[109.75,46.0,109.75,$[parseNumber::(calc::(46.0-20.0*findNotEmpty::(get::(${hourly},precipitation_probability[3]),0)/100),0.0)]]",
            "lineWidth": "2.6pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "strokeColor": "$[if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${hourly},precipitation_probability[3]),0),50),#9FD4FF,#80FFFFFF)]"
          },
          {
            "type": "line",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "points": "[114.25,46.0,114.25,$[parseNumber::(calc::(46.0-20.0*findNotEmpty::(get::(${hourly},precipitation_probability[4]),0)/100),0.0)]]",
            "lineWidth": "2.6pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "strokeColor": "$[if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${hourly},precipitation_probability[4]),0),50),#9FD4FF,#80FFFFFF)]"
          },
          {
            "type": "line",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "points": "[118.75,46.0,118.75,$[parseNumber::(calc::(46.0-20.0*findNotEmpty::(get::(${hourly},precipitation_probability[5]),0)/100),0.0)]]",
            "lineWidth": "2.6pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "strokeColor": "$[if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${hourly},precipitation_probability[5]),0),50),#9FD4FF,#80FFFFFF)]"
          },
          {
            "type": "line",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "points": "[123.25,46.0,123.25,$[parseNumber::(calc::(46.0-20.0*findNotEmpty::(get::(${hourly},precipitation_probability[6]),0)/100),0.0)]]",
            "lineWidth": "2.6pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "strokeColor": "$[if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${hourly},precipitation_probability[6]),0),50),#9FD4FF,#80FFFFFF)]"
          },
          {
            "type": "line",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "points": "[127.75,46.0,127.75,$[parseNumber::(calc::(46.0-20.0*findNotEmpty::(get::(${hourly},precipitation_probability[7]),0)/100),0.0)]]",
            "lineWidth": "2.6pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "strokeColor": "$[if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${hourly},precipitation_probability[7]),0),50),#9FD4FF,#80FFFFFF)]"
          },
          {
            "type": "line",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "points": "[132.25,46.0,132.25,$[parseNumber::(calc::(46.0-20.0*findNotEmpty::(get::(${hourly},precipitation_probability[8]),0)/100),0.0)]]",
            "lineWidth": "2.6pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "strokeColor": "$[if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${hourly},precipitation_probability[8]),0),50),#9FD4FF,#80FFFFFF)]"
          },
          {
            "type": "line",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "points": "[136.75,46.0,136.75,$[parseNumber::(calc::(46.0-20.0*findNotEmpty::(get::(${hourly},precipitation_probability[9]),0)/100),0.0)]]",
            "lineWidth": "2.6pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "strokeColor": "$[if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${hourly},precipitation_probability[9]),0),50),#9FD4FF,#80FFFFFF)]"
          },
          {
            "type": "line",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "points": "[141.25,46.0,141.25,$[parseNumber::(calc::(46.0-20.0*findNotEmpty::(get::(${hourly},precipitation_probability[10]),0)/100),0.0)]]",
            "lineWidth": "2.6pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "strokeColor": "$[if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${hourly},precipitation_probability[10]),0),50),#9FD4FF,#80FFFFFF)]"
          },
          {
            "type": "line",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "points": "[145.75,46.0,145.75,$[parseNumber::(calc::(46.0-20.0*findNotEmpty::(get::(${hourly},precipitation_probability[11]),0)/100),0.0)]]",
            "lineWidth": "2.6pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "strokeColor": "$[if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${hourly},precipitation_probability[11]),0),50),#9FD4FF,#80FFFFFF)]"
          },
          {
            "id": "hS",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "94.0pt",
            "y": "49pt",
            "w": "28pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "$[subString::(get::(${hourly},time[0]),11,13)]${@i18n.w_hr}",
            "fontSize": "8pt",
            "textColor": "#B3FFFFFF|#A6FFFFFF",
            "maxLines": "1"
          },
          {
            "id": "hE",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "120pt",
            "y": "49pt",
            "w": "28pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "$[subString::(get::(${hourly},time[11]),11,13)]${@i18n.w_hr}",
            "fontSize": "8pt",
            "textColor": "#B3FFFFFF|#A6FFFFFF",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "alignmentH": "2"
          }
        ],
        "_note": "有数据才画柱与刻度(空数据时 get 求空,刻度会渲成孤零零的「时」)。"
      }
    ],
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "w_hr": "时",
        "w_rnNow": "下雨中",
        "w_rnNowS": "降水概率 ",
        "w_rnAtS": "起可能下雨",
        "w_rnNone": "无雨",
        "w_rnNoneS": "未来 12 小时"
      },
      "en-US": {
        "w_hr": "h",
        "w_rnNow": "Raining",
        "w_rnNowS": "Chance ",
        "w_rnAtS": "Rain likely",
        "w_rnNone": "No rain",
        "w_rnNoneS": "Next 12 hours"
      }
    }
  }
}
